#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0084 expect=violation domain=ADSL
#note "Combined review of runbook W2-W8, XCUT H1 (red-before on the pre-fix engine: 0 findings). row_max(name_pattern=) has no column operand, so the level calculus classified $trxx_max dataset-level and every reader took ROW 0's maximum for the whole table: row 1 has no TRxxEDT at all, its maximum is missing, so `not empty($trxx_max)` folded FALSE for the dataset and nothing fired. Per row: row 1 has no candidate (clean), row 2's max 22010 != TRTEDT 22000 (fires), row 3's max equals TRTEDT (clean)."
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt row=2 USUBJID=01-002 "$trxx_max"=22010
dataset ADSL
col STUDYID  type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col TRTEDT   type=Num
col TR01EDT  type=Num
col TR02EDT  type=Num
---
S1 | 01-001 | 22000 |       |
S1 | 01-002 | 22000 | 22010 | 21990
S1 | 01-003 | 22010 | 22010 | 21990
---
